; GRIFO - BG tileset, stage 1 (pradera, bosque, rio, murallas, torres, niebla) + turrets + boss.
; Drawn by pixel-artist (generated, then this file is the source of truth). Tile 0 = BLANK = NIEBLA
; (flat color 0): fog, the boss background and the off-screen columns 20-31 all use tile 0.
; Level geometry = 16x16 metatiles of 4 tiles (TL TR BL BR). DMG BG tiles cannot flip, so
; TURRET_R is a hand-mirrored copy of TURRET_L. Identical tiles are stored once: metatiles
; that reuse tiles (fills, edges, corners) must be built from the METATILE TABLE below, not
; from consecutive labels. Turrets and crater always own 4 consecutive tiles (NAME_TL..NAME_BR).
; Palette: drawn for BGP 0xE4. Color 3 only on turrets, gate and boss: bullets read everywhere.
; Boss flash ('clara' palette below the HUD cut) also lightens the terrain: there is none, fog only.
;
; METATILE TABLE  (id name: TL TR BL BR | level char | role)
;   0 FOG       :   0   0   0   0 | ' ' | NIEBLA: flat color 0 (fog, also plain white field). No turret.
;   1 GRASS     :   1   2   3   4 | ',' | ground (meadow)
;   2 GRASS2    :   5   0   0   0 | '.' | ground (meadow, near-empty variant)
;   3 FLOWERS   :   6   7   8   9 | '*' | ground (meadow)
;   4 BUSH      :  10  11  12  13 | 'b' | ground deco (meadow)
;   5 PATH      :  14  15  16  17 | ':' | ground (dirt road, vertical)
;   6 TREE      :  18  19  20  21 | 'T' | ground deco (single tree)
;   7 FOREST    :  22  23  24  25 | 'F' | ground (canopy)
;   8 FOREST_N  :  26  27  24  25 | 'n' | ground (canopy, top edge)
;   9 FOREST_S  :  28  29  30  31 | 'u' | ground (canopy, bottom edge)
;  10 FOREST_W  :  32  23  33  25 | '(' | ground (canopy, left edge)
;  11 FOREST_E  :  22  34  24  35 | ')' | ground (canopy, right edge)
;  12 FOREST_NW :  36  27  33  25 | '1' | ground (canopy corner)
;  13 FOREST_NE :  26  37  24  35 | '2' | ground (canopy corner)
;  14 FOREST_SW :  38  29  39  31 | '3' | ground (canopy corner)
;  15 FOREST_SE :  28  40  30  41 | '4' | ground (canopy corner)
;  16 WATER     :  42  43  43  42 | '~' | WATER (no turret)
;  17 SHORE_W   :  44  43  45  42 | '[' | WATER edge, land left (no turret)
;  18 SHORE_E   :  42  46  43  47 | ']' | WATER edge, land right (no turret)
;  19 SHORE_N   :  48  49  43  42 | '-' | WATER edge, land above (no turret)
;  20 SHORE_S   :  42  43  50  51 | '_' | WATER edge, land below (no turret)
;  21 SHORE_NW  :  52  49  45  42 | '5' | WATER corner (no turret)
;  22 SHORE_NE  :  48  53  43  47 | '6' | WATER corner (no turret)
;  23 SHORE_SW  :  44  43  54  51 | '7' | WATER corner (no turret)
;  24 SHORE_SE  :  42  46  50  55 | '8' | WATER corner (no turret)
;  25 BRIDGE_W  :  56  57  58  59 | '{' | bridge start on left bank (no turret)
;  26 BRIDGE    :  60  57  61  59 | '=' | bridge over water (no turret)
;  27 BRIDGE_E  :  60  62  61  63 | '}' | bridge end on right bank (no turret)
;  28 COBBLE    :  64  65  66  67 | 'c' | ground (paved courtyard)
;  29 WALL_TOP  :  68  69  70  71 | 'M' | ground (wall walk, north parapet) - turrets OK
;  30 WALL_FACE :  72  73  74  74 | 'W' | ground (south parapet + face + shadow)
;  31 GATE      :  75  76  77  78 | 'G' | ground (gate in WALL_FACE)
;  32 WALL_V    :  79  80  79  80 | '|' | ground (N-S wall walk) - turrets OK
;  33 ROOF_W    :  81  82  83  84 | 'r' | ground deco (house, left half)
;  34 ROOF_E    :  85  86  87  88 | 'R' | ground deco (house, right half)
;  35 TOWER_NW  :  89  90  91  92 | 'q' | ground (round keep 32x32, top-left)
;  36 TOWER_NE  :  93  94  95  96 | 'p' | ground (round keep, top-right)
;  37 TOWER_SW  :  97  98  99 100 | 'd' | ground (round keep, bottom-left)
;  38 TOWER_SE  : 101 102 103 104 | 'k' | ground (round keep, bottom-right)
;  39 CONE      : 105 106 107 108 | 'A' | ground deco (small tower, cone roof)
;  40 FOG_LO    : 109 109 110 110 | '%' | ground (fog bank start, over terrain)
;  41 FOG_HI    : 111   0 112 112 | '^' | fog thinning (treat as fog: no turret)
;  42 TURRET_L  : 113 114 115 116 | --- | TURRET aiming left (dir 4-11) - runtime
;  43 TURRET_D  : 117 118 119 120 | 't' | TURRET aiming down (other dirs) - level char t
;  44 TURRET_R  : 121 122 123 124 | --- | TURRET aiming right (dir 21-28) - runtime
;  45 CRATER    : 125 126 127 128 | --- | destroyed turret - runtime
;  46 BOSS_0    : 129 130 131 132 | --- | BOSS metatile row 0 col 0
;  47 BOSS_1    : 133 134 135 136 | --- | BOSS metatile row 0 col 1
;  48 BOSS_2    : 137 138 139 140 | --- | BOSS metatile row 0 col 2
;  49 BOSS_3    : 141 142 143 144 | --- | BOSS metatile row 0 col 3
;  50 BOSS_4    : 145 146 147 148 | --- | BOSS metatile row 1 col 0
;  51 BOSS_5    : 149 150 151 152 | --- | BOSS metatile row 1 col 1
;  52 BOSS_6    : 153 154 155 156 | --- | BOSS metatile row 1 col 2
;  53 BOSS_7    : 157 158 159 160 | --- | BOSS metatile row 1 col 3
;  54 BOSS_8    : 161 162   0   0 | --- | BOSS metatile row 2 col 0
;  55 BOSS_9    : 163 164   0 165 | --- | BOSS metatile row 2 col 1
;  56 BOSS_10   : 166 167 168   0 | --- | BOSS metatile row 2 col 2
;  57 BOSS_11   : 169 170   0   0 | --- | BOSS metatile row 2 col 3
;
; BOSS 64x48 = 8x6 tiles = metatiles BOSS_0..BOSS_11 (4 per row, rows top->bottom), placed in
; map columns 3-6; on screen x 48..111. Tile map (tile indices, row-major, 8 per row):
;   129 130 133 134 137 138 141 142
;   131 132 135 136 139 140 143 144
;   145 146 149 150 153 154 157 158
;   147 148 151 152 155 156 159 160
;   161 162 163 164 166 167 169 170
;     0   0   0 165 168   0   0   0
; Emitters (px from the boss top-left): mouth (32,40), left claw (8,36), right claw (56,36).
;
; Last tile DOT = template alias for main.c (init_bkg(BG_DOT)); delete when main.c drops it.

